      {
         "id": "SECTION_prerequisites",
         "text": [
            {
               "text": "### Prerequisites\n\nWe suggest you first read the text about navigating the menus.",
               "source": null,
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
               "PostMention": ""
            }
         ]
      },
      {
         "id": "SECTION_introduction",
         "text": [
            {
               "text": "### Introduction\n\nThe sidebar is organized into sections. Each section groups content of a similar theme and has a title followed by its options. Below, we describe each section and what you will find in it.",
               "source": null,
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
               "PostMention": ""
            }
         ]
      },
      {
         "id": "SECTION_main",
         "text": [
            {
               "text": "### Main\n\nThe *Main* section brings the general pages of the site: *Home*, *Acknowledgement*, *Partnership*, *Contact*, *Licence*, *Version*, *Gallery*, and *Documentation*.",
               "source": null,
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
               "PostMention": ""
            }
         ]
      },
      {
         "id": "SECTION_sciences",
         "text": [
            {
               "text": "### Sciences\n\nThe *Sciences* section gathers the texts that introduce scientific thought: *The Knowledge*, *Scientific Method*, *Sources*, and *Philosophy*.",
               "source": null,
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
               "PostMention": ""
            }
         ]
      },
      {
         "id": "SECTION_other_sciences",
         "text": [
            {
               "text": "### Other science sections\n\n*The Foundations* brings *First Steps* and *Universe*. *Chemical* brings *The Origin of Matter*. *Geography* brings *Atlas*. *Biology* brings *The Origin of Life*. *Literature* brings *Understanding Texts*.",
               "source": null,
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
               "PostMention": ""
            }
         ]
      },
      {
         "id": "SECTION_human_sciences",
         "text": [
            {
               "text": "### History, Genealogy, and Indigenous\n\n*History* brings *General History*, *Genealogical Trees*, *Myths and Believes*, and *Historical Events*. *Genealogy* brings *F.Q.A.* and *My Ancestors*. *Indigenous* brings *Chronology* and *Who ... ?*.",
               "source": null,
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
               "PostMention": ""
            }
         ]
      },
      {
         "id": "SECTION_games",
         "text": [
            {
               "text": "### Games\n\n*Games* brings the interactive activities of the site, such as *Math*.",
               "source": null,
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
               "PostMention": ""
            }
         ]
      },
      {
         "id": "SECTION_conclusion",
         "text": [
            {
               "text": "### Conclusion\n\nWith this guide, you now know what each menu of History Tracers offers. Explore the sections and enjoy the content.",
               "source": null,
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
               "PostMention": ""
            }
         ]
      }
   ],
